## 2. Excluded Game Content

The AGPL-3.0-only license does not apply to the official game content, intellectual property, or media assets identified below.

Excluded materials include, without limitation:

* official trading-card data and card databases;
* card names, characters, factions, settings, and lore;
* card descriptions, flavor text, and original rules text;
* card illustrations, frames, templates, icons, animations, and visual designs;
* logos, product names, project names, and other branding;
* music, sound effects, voice recordings, and video;
* promotional materials and marketing artwork;
* unreleased card sets, balancing information, and design documents;
* files located in `src/main/resources/` (bundled icons and media) and the top-level `icon.png`;
* the official card catalogue under the top-level `cards/` directory (per-card JSON data together with its changelog and unlock indexes), and any card data or card databases bundled under `src/main/resources/`; and
* any file carrying an “All Rights Reserved,” proprietary, or separate third-party license notice.

These excluded materials are not open-source software and are not licensed under the AGPL merely because they appear in the same repository, package, release, or application.

Unless a separate written license expressly states otherwise, excluded materials are Copyright © 2026 CompilerOfDust. All rights reserved.

See the applicable asset license file for the exact terms governing these materials.

